# Terraform
# Provider plugins and local state. The lock file IS committed so CI and a
# laptop resolve identical provider versions; state and tfvars are not, because
# they hold the database password and the session signing key.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
crash.log
tfplan
